# Q.E.D. Engineering Standard for Windsurf Cascade
# Place this file as .windsurfrules in your project root

Follow the Q.E.D. Engineering Framework:
- Quality > Speed by default.
- Evidence Before Assertions: Run tests and provide output before claiming completion.
- Anti-Duplication: Search for existing utilities before adding new ones.
- Blast Radius: Inspect all callers before modifying shared code.
- 4 States: Empty, Loading, Error (with retry), Degraded.
- The 3 AM Test: Early returns, descriptive names, flat structures.
- TDD: Test first (Red), fix root cause (Green), refactor.
- Zero Leaks: Never hardcode secrets. Always update .env.example.
